        <item>
            <title>3.10.4</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 19:54:08 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>162</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.10.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New in 3.10.4</h2><ul></ul><p><strong>Added</strong></p><ul><li>Added a Created Time block for file names</li></ul><p><strong>Improved</strong></p><ul><li>Improved custom AI and metadata naming blocks</li><li>Improved Ollama and LM Studio setup, connections, and model startup</li><li>Made naming behavior more consistent across cloud and local AI</li><li>Improved handling of longer files with local AI</li></ul><p><strong>Changed</strong></p><ul><li>Local AI now connects through Ollama or LM Studio instead of using a bundled model</li></ul>
]]></description>
